      "content": "idk if healing is even possible. everything feels so permanent now. the way they look at me, the way people talk about how much potential i had... it's all gone. instead of fixing it, i just feel like i've ruined my entire legacy. wouldn't it have been better if i just stayed at the top, instead of falling this hard? like, isn't it better to leave while people still remember the person i actually was?",
